postcts:Applying the recommended capacitance filtering threshold values for 45nm process node: total_c_th=0, relative_c_th=1 and coupling_c_th=0.1.
postcts:	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
