sta:@flow 4: # The FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS is an environment variable which should be exported by
sta:@flow 5: # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
sta:@flow 6: # for batch jobs with the current flow scripts.  The LSB_MAX_NUM_PROCESSORS is
sta:@flow 7: # a typical environment variable exported by distribution platforms and is
sta:@flow 8: # useful for ensuring all interactive jobs are using the reserved amount of CPUs.
sta:@flow 9: if {[info exists ::env(FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS)]} {
sta:@flow 10: set max_cpus $::env(FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS)
sta:@flow 11: }
